{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56856","headline":"凤凰台兽相和歌（题拟） 八 · 不详","name":"凤凰台兽相和歌（题拟） 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒灯未灭夜愁添，轻帐低垂薄似烟。\n忘却闺中病无寐，空教魂梦到君边。\n（又和。\n见元林坤《诚斋杂记》卷下，元伊世珍《琅环记》卷上引《诚斋杂记》。\n）（〖1〗《诚斋杂记》云：「唐大历中，有人独行到凤凰台，望见一男子与一妇人相和而歌，声澈云际。\n」「歌罢，其人迫而视之，乃二兽焉，一类猪而体特高，蔚有文彩，一类龙而小，遍体纯黄色。\n其人惊而走。\n行者问之因语其故，共往观之，寂然无所见，惟竹书一束在地。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}